{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LISTEN 3 is a biocyberpunk horror game about a blind test subject who hears more than he sees.</strong><br>Activate your sonar implant, scan your surroundings, memorize enemy positions \u2014 and survive.<br>A voice guides you through the dark: a trapped dispatcher watching you through the last working cameras. She promises freedom\u2026 if you can reach her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to save her \u2014 and escape together from a ruined underground facility.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909780/extras/b0c3c32096d122415b20eeaebf6e89c5.poster.avif?t=1769431571\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909780/extras/b0c3c32096d122415b20eeaebf6e89c5.webm?t=1769431571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909780/extras/b0c3c32096d122415b20eeaebf6e89c5.mp4?t=1769431571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But every elevator ride costs power. To move up, you'll need to find energy cells. And remember \u2014 your weapon drains from the same battery.<br>Every shot is a gamble: kill or be left powerless next to a dead elevator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use implants. Listen. Memorize. Fire into the dark \u2014 and pray you hit your target.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3909780?t=1769431571","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909780/7d439ffde9ecdc9a8ae71e53d51e4714e22ae5ce/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769431571","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909780/3f47c569ef2919727b5a94ec04e6ffce976690fc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769431571","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909780/3f47c569ef2919727b5a94ec04e6ffce976690fc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769431571","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"LISTEN 3 contains psychological tension and dark, unsettling themes. The protagonist is a blind test subject navigating a pitch-black biotech facility filled with mutants.\r\n\r\nPlayers can eliminate enemies using a plasma-based weapon, but there is no blood or gore \u2014 enemies instantly disintegrate into dust when hit. No other acts of violence, sexual or otherwise, are depicted in the game.\r\n\r\nThe game includes moments of high tension, sudden sounds, potential falls from height (players can slip off bridges), and narrative elements involving ethical dilemmas and emotional manipulation."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LISTEN 3 is a biocyberpunk horror game about a blind test subject who hears more than he sees.</strong><br>Activate your sonar implant, scan your surroundings, memorize enemy positions \u2014 and survive.<br>A voice guides you through the dark: a trapped dispatcher watching you through the last working cameras. She promises freedom\u2026 if you can reach her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to save her \u2014 and escape together from a ruined underground facility.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909780/extras/b0c3c32096d122415b20eeaebf6e89c5.poster.avif?t=1769431571\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909780/extras/b0c3c32096d122415b20eeaebf6e89c5.webm?t=1769431571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909780/extras/b0c3c32096d122415b20eeaebf6e89c5.mp4?t=1769431571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But every elevator ride costs power. To move up, you'll need to find energy cells. And remember \u2014 your weapon drains from the same battery.<br>Every shot is a gamble: kill or be left powerless next to a dead elevator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use implants. Listen. Memorize. Fire into the dark \u2014 and pray you hit your target.</p>","developers":["Drunk Hogs Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909780/db641cecdea61d49c8a316da666d2007445b3a3b/header.jpg?t=1769431571","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"LISTEN 3","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 (6 GB) / AMD RX 580 (8 GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 35 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-10700 / AMD Ryzen 5 5600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li>